Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan and his\Ngreatest challenge yet, to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mama, lots of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:02:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never forget Ghetto, the key\Nis to size up your target.
