Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe the machine, the prize's position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Note the strength of the\Nclaw's grip and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then when the moment is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How complex.
