Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more effortless you\Nmake it look, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earn a high score in the game of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10,000 yen gone! Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you should steer clear of this\Nmachine until you've had more practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put in a coin, hey?
