Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, it's so cute! All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this supposed to be fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one likes a party pooper, Gedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I rescind my comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, it's all about the memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're commemorating the\Nfun both of us had today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to print out this memory?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.29,0:04:19.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnArial\an8\fs12\fax-0.18\move(325,222,355,222)\frz52.7\frx352\fry24}Check the slot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a girl started talking\Nabout DIY candy kits with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try forcing a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you can get caught up\Nin something your date enjoys,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.39,0:04:34.39,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\b1\frz14\bord4\shad0\blur0.3\fs32\move(513,296,513,470)\c&H4128A1&\3c&HDBD8DF&}Lock on \Nto your \Nheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might be surprised\Nby how much fun you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we should call it a day -
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we do, you have\Nto take a picture with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Kimie Arashiyama,\Nlet me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.75,0:05:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to hire Gero so you've\Nbeen following him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have reached\Nout on the dark nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a babe as\Nsmokin' as me in centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, you should be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call that a red flag. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should hear me out before\Nyou leave my life forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, stalking the guy you want\Nto hire doesn't exactly inspire trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a sec, I was convinced the Hitman\NHunter had come to get Gero. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually a master, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone comes along and\Ntakes care of the hitman hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a target, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:05:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you were a master, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So shouldn't you be able\Nto protect yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am, but you see, fighting\Nreally isn't my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we ought to stay and hear her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Arashiyama went through all this trouble\Nto seek help from a complete stranger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she must be in a pretty tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama? Arashiyama? Arashiyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Master Hikaru, seriously\Nbeing this nice to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, he's holding me\Nin his arms, calling out my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually paying attention to\Nme is still good to be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I found out the hitman hunter\Nwas after me, I was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then as luck would have it,\NI meet Master Hikaru Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even make an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's inconvenient, but\Nhe's treating me so courteously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I receive an\Nanswer to my prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and give it your best shot,\Nsucker, because I'm untouchable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try and take me out, Hitman Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look, I never said I'd take the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, her lab sure does carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wondering, just\Nwhat kind of master am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Kimi Arashiyama,\Nthe Hamster Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my partner, Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know, he's the reason\NI was able to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to intel gathering or\Nanything that requires a delicate touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me and my hamster are the ones to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuteness overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're related to the beast clan while
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all masters might be\Nexpertly trained killers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not necessarily skilled in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm more about assassination\Nand traps, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seriously consider that amateur hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want anything\Nto do with The hitman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hunter but my association\Nsaid the hunt was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all fired up\Nabout taking this jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're in danger so you\Nwant a bodyguard? Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of approaching\Nme why not ask someone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within your own clan to protect you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until my great-great-grandpa's\Ngeneration we were Ratmasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,main Beast Clan respected us so\Nwe had weight to throw around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now our bloodline has thinned\Nout so much I wouldn't be surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we ended up getting stripped\Nof our master title tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly helping things\Nsince I have zero kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This collar is the only link I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the branches of the\NBeast Clan must wear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I show up to association\Nmeetings when they tell me to,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they've already decided the most\Nimportant stuff by the time I've arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like taking on the hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what they told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.59,0:09:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A master who doesn't or can't kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and works a normal job at a normal company
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is only good for being\None thing, a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got carried away earlier, like the future\Nhead of one of the five great families?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would ever guard a branch family nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, there's no way I can\Nafford your massive fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:10:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I got to meet my fave before I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10,000 yen a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just need to know when to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure about this, Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in a real bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kind of derails my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least Gero's charms are\Nstarting to shine through on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've dreamt of this for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Advice! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try hugging her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.07,0:10:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Hikaru Gero an assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you to meet the\Nrest of the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, they'll find out\Nabout you eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the real Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the most unhinged woman so far,\Nbut she is a fellow master. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of them might actually hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\blur0.3\fs15\c&H587053&\3c&HDFEAEB&\frx30\move(316,3.43,316,51.43)}Cuddly {\bord1.5\c&H7DB9B7&\3c&H628171&}An{\c&HC2C58F&\3c&H72826E&}im{\c&HACA7CB&\3c&H707478&}al {\c&H8FC9A6&\3c&H708A7B&}P{\c&HB7C4CD&\3c&H738778&}la{\c&HCEC5D9&\3c&H747775&}za
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\blur0.3\fs12\c&H40238C&\3c&HDFEAEB&\move(310,78,310,126)\frx24}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serpent Master Ryuma.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.63,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(102.29,235.43)}Serpent Master\NRyumon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owl Master, Chojabaru.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(448,220)}Owl Master, Chojabaru
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(320,215.43)}Hippo Master, Shibaseki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hippo Master, Shibaseki.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(438.29,203.43)}Orca Master\NKankaiji
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orca Master Konkaiji.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.89,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(384,254)}Buffalo Master\NHorita
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buffalo Master Heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.89,0:11:25.89,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs25\bord0\shad0\pos(278.86,290.86)}Alligator Master\NHamawaki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alligator Master Hamawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the animals are fine,\Nbut the humans are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you with the clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, you're supposed to be\Nthe Poison Master, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ndoing here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, your timing's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This saves me from\Nhaving to track you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big name now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can cross you off my list.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.03,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}The Hitman{\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)} Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stab Ghetto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any deeper and it could have been fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've stopped the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the hitman hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With one little knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let this drag out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there enough time to set a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just got to face him head-on\Nand go all out from the start.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.66,0:13:37.73,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord0.7\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H8B85F2&\pos(480,-5)\3c&HBCC3F4&}Toxin: Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Optical reflex accelerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muscle reflex enhancer.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.16,0:13:42.23,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord0.7\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H8B85F2&\pos(410,-5)\3c&HBCC3F4&}Toxin: Javelin Strike
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin javelin strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That double dose should\Nend this fight fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you, but the Poison Master\Nis still an assassin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking bodyguard\Ngigs on the Dark Nav?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you've got the right guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one in the five families\Nwould be caught dead doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, he seems dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shot two syringes into\Nhis own neck. Two! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of risky, letting him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it's probably for\Nthe best if I take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat him to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic Vision's not able\Nto keep track of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.65,0:15:32.01,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,0)\pos(305,290)\bord0}You'd better believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a soft spot for animals, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like\Nthey did anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A branch of the Iron Clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I'm just a normal guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which family sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, why would I lie to\Nsomebody who's about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of my relatives are teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.09,0:16:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, he's got to be a mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masters spend generations\Nbuilding up their bloodlines,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow this freak has\Nsurpassed them in only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For lunch pretty soon,\Ndamn it. I've never tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This before, but I've got no\Nchoice. Toxin: Triple Dose.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.70,0:16:21.64,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord0.7\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H8B85F2&\pos(430,-5)\3c&HBCC3F4&}Toxin: Triple Dose
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes, come on, why did you\Ngo and do that? It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known a triple\Ndose might have worked
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I hadn't already lost so much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all the hatred you\Nspread, this is what you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just promise me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't touch either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Hitman Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gator's not dying on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.81,0:17:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules just did a 180!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, if you get in the way, I've\Ngot to take care of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big dummy, shove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's going\Naround spreading hatred?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like hell he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He offered to be my bodyguard,\Neven when I couldn't pay him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't gonna go down at\Nthe shield for some jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm more than happy\Nto die for my idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serious squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++. Feel the\Nwrath of Canis Major unleashed?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\q2\bord0.7\shad0\fscx90\fs50\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,1)\3c&H482E90&}Modified Bloodline++: Canis Major
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greater dog that\Nshines in the winter sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously the hospital,\Nsince he's dying and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Canis Major actually worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were dead set on killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why save my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masters looking out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I don't feel like\Nkilling you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...are something I can handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Piichi Nakagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's it my turn to\Nhave his head on my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminating the Beast Clan, one of\Nthe five great families for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.63,0:19:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor is they're planning something major,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something dangerous that'll\Nkill a whole lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured I'd take them out\Nbefore the damage got out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how come you're hunting\Npeople outside of their clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well. Come again?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.53,0:19:25.28,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an8\fscx90\shad0\blur0.3\bord2.5\fs18\fax-0.45\frz20\move(106,128,106,-260)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(30,640,\3c&H1FE3F4&\c&H4A507B&)\fry10}Itabashi Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I had no idea where\Nto even start looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I asked anyone who could\Nsteer me in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.39,0:19:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which led me to a homicidal\Nmaniac they once did a deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there was the guy\Nwith the pointy stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus those six from the branch families.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weren't much help, but it's\Nnot like I could let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what maniac?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dan the Dismemberer He\Ndidn't work for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took apart old men as payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kushima the Spearmaster\NHe had a reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for involving innocent\Nbystanders in his jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is to open a\Ncafe with my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I can do that, somebody\Nneeds to clean up the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our poor customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is his head still on her lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feuding with one of the\Nfive great families?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.75,0:20:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but wouldn't it be better without\Nthese bad guys to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd write that off as a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with his abilities, he\Nmight be able to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, there's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the family of\NPoison Masters was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it turns out you're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you're not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not to the world I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe that'll change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, that means you're gonna\Nlet us go, right? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, problem solved, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato, you're from one\Nof the five families.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can tell me what\Nthe Beast Clan is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.91,0:21:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like I'd know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People call us the five great\Nfamilies out of convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have\Nany sort of connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a branch of the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been to the main\Nhouse or met the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is I have the collar\Nthey give all the branch members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with her, Kato?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's this collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't remove that unless you\Nwanted to completely drain a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bonda Constrictor is a living\Naccessory engineered to suck blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went ahead and activated it, meaning\Nthat woman's got three days to live, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why make her aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want him running off, would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The livestock, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare me the death glare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're actually interested in facing\Nme, Hikaru Gero and Piichi Nakagawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See me on the Beast Clan's\Nhome turf, Dogo Animal Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, make that noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.89,0:22:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.05,0:22:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, make that noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the\Nout-to-na-ni-yo-i-wata-si-bick-ri-dottk-ri-fum-da-ri-ke-t-ri-muh-ga-muchu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,\Nout-to-na-ni-yo-i-an-ata-hattari-ba-kari-un-zari-gakari-bye-bye-chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it. I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.87,0:22:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is 100 % a trap, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what somebody who's\Nas good as mine can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.93,0:23:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(316,262)}The Animal Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the Animal Kingdom.

